---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import data from '../data/portfolio.json';
---
<section class="gut" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="contact">
      <h2>Got a process that should run itself?</h2>
      <p class="contact-sub">Tell me what your team does by hand today. I'll show you what it looks like as a flow.</p>
      <div class="row">
        <code id="email">{data.profile.email}</code>
        <button class="btn gold" id="copy" type="button" data-email={data.profile.email}><Icon name="copy" /><span>Copy email</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <a class="btn" href={data.profile.links.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="linkedin-logo" />LinkedIn</a>
        <a class="btn" href={data.profile.links.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="github-logo" />GitHub</a>
      </div>
      <p class="note-link">Not ready to talk yet? <a href="/guestbook/">Sign my wall</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
